{"type":"text","timestamp":1790445152947,"sessionID":"ses_f212b5572ffe7iSWCB09wN1s3L","part":{"id":"prt_0ded8eaa30010TlSN4462tkcOx","messageID":"msg_0ded8a452001eDS9j5VMpdtOiC","sessionID":"ses_f212b5572ffe7iSWCB09wN1s3L","type":"text","text":"Root cause: nodes instantiated via code with declared groups must call `add_to_group(\"FlashlightPoints\", true)` to live-persist; the saved file is correct, but a raw `add_child` in my harness doesn't trigger the declared-group registration unless the owner is set. Let me fix the verifier to mirror how Godot actually loads a main scene:","time":{"start":1790445152931,"end":1790445152935},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_e11a338e37d14a6483d4ddca72ed92d5_msg"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790445152967,"sessionID":"ses_f212b5572ffe7iSWCB09wN1s3L","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"write_12_7873c193","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"extends SceneTree\n\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tvar scene: PackedScene = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\")\n\tvar main: Node = scene.instantiate()\n\troot.add_child(main)\n\t# Emulate how Godot instantiates the main scene's hierarchy.\n\tmain.owner = null\n\t_register_tree(main, main)\n\tvar group_nodes := get_nodes_in_group(\"FlashlightPoints\")\n\tprint(\"group_size=\", group_nodes.size())\n\tfor g in group_nodes:\n\t\tprint(\"group_member=\", g.name, \" parent=\", g.get_parent().name, \" pos=\", g.position, \" priority=\", g.priority, \" targeted=\", g.has_been_targeted)\n\t\tg.has_been_targeted = true\n\t\tg.reset_target_state()\n\t\tprint(\"after_reset=\", g.has_been_targeted)\n\tquit()\n\n\nfunc _register_tree(node: Node, scene_root: Node) -> void:\n\tfor child in node.get_children():\n\t\tchild.owner = scene_root\n\t\t_register_tree(child, scene_root)\n","filePath":"/workspace/_verify.gd"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/_verify.gd","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"workspace/_verify.gd","time":{"start":1790445152944,"end":1790445152950}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_write_12_7873c193"}},"id":"prt_0ded8eaa9001xAQo4aw6N1Ibt9","sessionID":"ses_f212b5572ffe7iSWCB09wN1s3L","messageID":"msg_0ded8a452001eDS9j5VMpdtOiC"}}
